※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 3206 LANG_ATTR_EXPECT_NOT_RAISED

※ 'expect' asserts that the construct raises the diagnostic, so one that nothing
※ meets is a statement about the program that is not true.  Here the value is
※ read, so no warning was there to suppress.
@[startup]
fn main() → u8:
    @[expect(4006)]
    let a: u8 = 5u8
    a
